  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed rear extension and rear dormer, by reason of their location and excessive bulk, would result in over development and unacceptable visual harm to the character and appearance of the host building and the wider terrace. As such the proposed extension would be contrary to policy D1 (Design) of the London Borough of Camden Local Plan 2017.",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposed rear extension, by reason of its location and scale, would be harmful to the residential amenity in terms of loss of light, outlook and overbearing impact to the rear of the first floor flat at 178 Iverson Road and the neighbouring roof terrace at 180 Iverson Road, contrary to policy A1 (Managing the impact of development) of the London Borough of Camden Local Plan 2017."
